    "description": "The first modular office partition system \u2014 freestanding fabric-covered panels that create semi-enclosed workspaces without permanent walls. Propst's research found that open offices were noisy and closed offices were isolated. Action Office II was his middle ground: visual privacy with acoustic separation, reconfigurable overnight.",
