    "significance": "Viewers should recognize how Conran uses material properties as the primary design generator. The Strata tumbler demonstrates that contemporary craft lies not in rejecting industrial precision but in using it to amplify inherent material qualities\u2014here, crystal's refractive potential becomes both decorative strategy and functional logic.",
